# Transient state of the understand-anything skill — deliberately not committed.
#
# tmp/          scratch space for the bundled pipeline scripts (batch inputs,
#               fingerprint input, the merge report, the inline validator).
# intermediate/ the pipeline's working files and the Phase 1 inventory. Local
#               scratch by upstream's guidance; regenerated on the next run.
# .trash-*/     what the skill's own cleanup step moves out of intermediate/,
#               kept for 7 days before it deletes them.
#
# Committed here: knowledge-graph.json, fingerprints.json, meta.json and
# .understandignore — see "Knowledge graph" in the repository README.
tmp/
intermediate/
.trash-*/
